WEBVTT

00:05:28.991 --> 00:05:31.660
Working with the teachers
and the school administration,

00:05:31.702 --> 00:05:35.331
they give me about one hour to test out
the game for the next couple weeks.

00:05:35.748 --> 00:05:37.917
And the game was a huge success.

00:05:37.958 --> 00:05:41.754
So much so, that the next morning
my mom woke me out of bed

00:05:41.796 --> 00:05:43.923
telling me that there was
a group of children

00:05:43.964 --> 00:05:46.675
wearing my school uniform, looking for me.

00:05:47.259 --> 00:05:50.638
I was still confused because it was
about 6am in the morning.

00:05:50.971 --> 00:05:53.891
But I woke up out of my bed,
still in my night dress actually,

00:05:53.933 --> 00:05:55.476
and then opened the door.

00:05:55.518 --> 00:05:57.061
There was about six children,

00:05:57.103 --> 00:05:58.813
and when I looked at them,

00:05:58.854 --> 00:06:01.273
there were about two faces
that I could recognize.